      <activity id="d3210945-ec86-5709-b00b-3b5f2345bd4d" activityNameId="1e130c80-c267-5d0d-a814-c4f90aabe154" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Storage 10000 l</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Storage 10000 l
Inventory refers to infrastructure of an existing natural gas cogeneration plant (lambda=1 motor, 160kWe, operation start 1987) at Jakobsberg, Basel, Switzerland. (Life time for operation assumed 100'000 h.);
UUID: beebd964-ecc7-3e1c-9acf-5322168746ce
The module includes the most important materials used for production. It includes also the transport of these materials and the water needed for production. It applies also modules for welding and sheet rolling.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Component of a specific cogeneration unit installed in Switzerland. Technology at end of 1980s.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Operator and manufacturer information 
Extrapolations: see Geography/Text
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_beebd964-ecc7-3e1c-9acf-5322168746ce.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
